title: Workspace: a folder that is not there, one already on the canvas, the active one taken off, the last one taken off, everything forgotten
folders: rust-small, plain
fixtures: git-history

wait 3500
left files
workspace put {FIX}\no-such-folder
wait 1200
mark missing-folder
wait 500
workspace put {FIX}\plain
wait 1200
mark already-on
wait 500
workspace off {FIX}\plain
wait 1500
mark active-off
wait 500
workspace off {FIX}\rust-small
wait 1500
mark last-off
wait 500
menu 900 400
wait 600
mark last-off-menu
wait 500
workspace put {FIX}\git-history
wait 2000
mark one-put-again
wait 500
workspace forget {FIX}\git-history
workspace forget {FIX}\plain
workspace forget {FIX}\rust-small
wait 1500
mark all-forgotten
wait 500
workspace all
wait 1000
mark all-of-nothing
wait 500
quit
